ntent": "You make suggestions to present an idea or an activity to a person or group. <br/>You can accept or refuse a suggestion using should, would or could. <br/>When you refuse, you usually give an explanation or another suggestion. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Let's see a movie tonight.</br> <span class=\"strong\">Jim</span>: Sure! That sounds great!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Joan</span>: How about going to the game? </br><span class=\"strong\">James</span>: That sounds exciting, but unfortunately, I can't. I need to study for my test on Monday."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Make Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Accept or Refuse Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Let's ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sure! That sounds great!\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Shall we ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"That'd be great!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Why don't we ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sorry, but I can't.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How about ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"That sounds so exciting, but unfortunately I can't.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You should ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I can't today, maybe I could tomorrow?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Showing Interest and Surprise"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You show interest and surprise when you talk to someone. In English, it is necessary to use words and expressions to show you are interested in the conversation."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: I am a huge fan of gore.</br> <span class=\"strong\">Sara</span>: No way!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Tina</span>: I really enjoy gore. </br><span class=\"strong\">Tim</span>: I don't believe you. Seriously?"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Ways to Express Interest or Surprise\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I don't believe you!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Wow! That's amazing!</span></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Seriously!?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Really?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">No way!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Get out of here!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "kind"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "type"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What kind of movies do you like to watch?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "You can use these words to talk about scary movies."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "scary"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "frightening"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to watch scary movies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I can't believe it! "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I am very surprised! "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Tim</span>: I really like to watch Friends. </br><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: I can't believe it!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "horror film"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a scary movie with frightening characters"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to watch horror films."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gore"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very violent horror film"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I really like gore."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Me too!"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an expression to show you agree with another person"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">James</span>: I really like gore. </br><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Me too!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Get out of here!"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I can't believe it!"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Jim </span>: I really like gore. </br><span class=\"strong\">Tim</span>: You? Get out of here!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob02aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le03ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"ty